# Code Owners
#
# Each line is a file pattern followed by one or more owners. The last
# matching pattern wins. Owners receive a review request automatically when
# a PR touches their files. Require a Code Owner review is enabled on main
# (see BRANCH_PROTECTION.md), so a PR that touches these files cannot merge
# without an owner approving it.
#
# Syntax reference: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owner for everything: the maintainer
*                               @bramburn

# Architecture and design rules - tight review
/AGENTS.md                      @bramburn
/BRANCH_PROTECTION.md           @bramburn
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md             @bramburn
/CONTRIBUTING.md                @bramburn

# Cloud build paths - safety-critical, must keep the four-safety-net rule
/tools/doctl-*.ps1              @bramburn
/tools/aliyun-*.ps1             @bramburn
/scripts/aliyun-*.sh            @bramburn
/tools/do-build.sh              @bramburn
/tools/setup-droplet.sh         @bramburn
/tools/apply-qalos.sh           @bramburn

# CI / GitHub config
/.github/workflows/             @bramburn
/.github/CODEOWNERS             @bramburn
/BRANCH_PROTECTION.md           @bramburn

# Docusaurus site - the user-facing docs
/website/                       @bramburn
/website/docs/                  @bramburn
/website/docusaurus.config.js   @bramburn
/website/sidebars.js            @bramburn
